Subject: [PATCH] onprem: offline vector basemap (PMTiles via
 protomaps-leaflet) as default map layer

---
 package.json                     |   1 +
 src/vendors/amap-leaflet-shim.ts |  19 +++++-
 yarn.lock                        | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

